    "source_contract": "VFileFromMemory wraps caller-owned fixed-size memory, installs _vfmWrite and _vfmClose, and does not expand. _vfmWrite clamps the transfer at bufferSize and returns the actual short count; _vfmClose frees only the wrapper. _GBACoreSavedataClone uses this backend for an output buffer, but that caller is source-traced only here.",
