      "source": "src/gba/core.c:1469-1490",
      "claim": "The caller allocates the output buffer, wraps it with VFileFromMemory, calls GBASavedataClone, and closes the VFile. The test does not compile or execute this GBA caller and does not establish how the caller handles partial writes."
    },
